<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces demolished houses in southern Lebanon, withdrew and allowed villagers to return to damaged homes while Lebanese President Aoun warned Israel to pull back and cautioned Iran against interference. An IDF spokesperson visited a Lebanese school, sparking outrage and prompting an analyst to warn the move could push Lebanese Christians toward Hezbollah. Israel publicly sent best wishes to Lebanon on its Independence Day, which was observed quietly amid muted celebrations and ongoing drone activity over Beirut and strikes on southern Lebanese towns. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNZnpuclR3SmtTOWFTNWphQmVaa2NuZFZVZXpYQjBKS2Jkb0NjLTZWbjlHNnJqcGh4RWQwd05qbGZfQ2V6YU14b0dMQzRhQ1JSSGw2alJlMzMyZTlNUWljU0NIeWwyS0NwS1VZb1FqN3VDV1dobzhlOVFpdU9UVjFDM0JEaTU3OGUtN2dXODcydkp5RVZSSDcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNN1FEdUg4Y1o3YXVsM1dOeVlDUmJYaTBZeXNDeFdjQmxkWGV4YU1qOXlDVTluUjM2aTE0cUxwZldhQVduajh4Z0pJUG16Q0VDT0VrQUFPaFozNnh6UnMtRGtiakhUd0hhMXp1bDE2cVhRRHE5ZEVOLTlJLXlSXzh3eFBqbjhlaWxRS2hjNV9STnQ5Y1o4ZnRzYmVVQVUzMzdpc1Z6LW5naTd2MUxlNDJCWWxLcm12NEdmekZZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxORll3ZkNWTTRuZ19vOTViOVlJZXlXczJUa0ZOWmN6M3JSVVlQbmhhZ0FsTTFrQUE4VDhDbjV6cGNyTVNOSnZxTUF2Z1p2NmE0MmhweGlLelliRnY2RkhUalpwWTgybUdsYWljc200MmFoWEFlbF9JWUJGZXBlREdJdTg3Q1Etdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFA1QXFWSWg0UEU3bmVHeFBEVHpkcWZXN24wLUdDODliSGJyUDQzckdIZ